omp-web (0.5.0) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Deliberate milestone version bump (0.3.10 -> 0.5.0), requested by the
    repo owner, to mark the .deb packaging redesign (issues/PRs #43, #44,
    #45) as a significant release rather than a continuation of the
    0.3.x bugfix line. This version carries no additional code changes
    beyond what already shipped in 0.3.9/0.3.10 below; the jump exists
    solely to give the packaging redesign its own release marker in the
    version history.
  * Summary of the redesign (see 0.3.9/0.3.10 entries below for full
    detail): stopped shipping `node_modules` and `.next/cache` inside the
    .deb, and instead have `postinst`'s `ensure_env()` materialize
    dependencies on the target host into a `bun.lock`-hash-keyed shared
    directory, symlinked into the app checkout, reusing bun's global
    content-addressable package cache. Net effect, LXC-verified end to
    end: installed-size dropped from ~2.79GB to ~290MB, and a reinstall
    with an unchanged `bun.lock` dropped from ~2m8s to ~5s (~25x faster).

